"  (e.g. pager)\n"
"<path> is the location of one of the alternative target files.\n"
"  (e.g. /usr/bin/less)\n"
"<priority> is an integer; options with higher numbers have higher priority "
"in\n"
"  automatic mode.\n"
"\n"
